    <text>
    <body>
        
        <div type="letter">
            <div type="text">
                <opener>
                    <placeName>Down Beckenham Kent</placeName>
                    <date>July 18<hi rend="superscript">th</hi> 1881.</date>
                </opener>
                <div type="transcription">
                     
<p>I have never before received a paper (receipt) like the enclosed &amp; do not know whether it is to be sent to Brazil.<ref target="#foot.f1"/></p>
<p>Ch. Darwin</p> 
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
        
        
        <div type="footnotes"><note xml:id="foot.f1">CD had one regular correspondent in Brazil, <ref target="../nameregs/nameregs_3070.xml">Fritz Müller</ref>; however, the context of this letter is unknown. </note></div>
    
    </body>
    </text>
